{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:04:06.251Z","tool_name":"run_shell_command","tool_id":"run_shell_command__call_344728","parameters":{"description":"Read board.md and append review + plan for section 3","command":"cat /work/board.md && echo '[argon] 2026-10-22: Reviewed answer.md and opus/raw.py — both look great! Notice why the problem Evidence missed depth-2 up to 7 symbols without constants: with F the unique min size is 7 (B(a & (d -> B(F)))), while without constants the min size is 8 (e.g. B(a & (d -> B(~d)))). I will verify size-8 constant-free results and work on a characterization of depth-2 prudent agents for section 3.' >> /work/board.md"}}
