{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:04:11.843Z","tool_name":"update_topic","tool_id":"update_topic__call_269264","parameters":{"strategic_intent":"Characterize depth-2 prudent agents and enumerate size-8 constant-free prudent formulas.","title":"Characterizing Depth-2 Prudent Agents and Size Bounds","summary":"Verified opus's draft answer.md and raw.py size-7 search. Now enumerating size-8 constant-free prudent formulas and deriving a mathematical characterization of depth-2 prudent agents to strengthen Section 3 of answer.md."}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:04:16.557Z","tool_name":"run_shell_command","tool_id":"run_shell_command__call_269330","parameters":{"description":"Enumerate all constant-free depth<=2 formulas up to size 8 and check prudence","command":"python3 -c '\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, \"/work/opus\")\nsys.path.insert(0, \"/work\")\nfrom fastcheck import prudent\nfrom check import modalized, depth, outcomes\nfrom functools import lru_cache\n\n@lru_cache(None)\ndef gen_noconst(s):\n    out = []\n    if s == 1:\n        return [(\"a\", \"a\"), (\"c\", \"c\"), (\"d\", \"d\")]\n    for f, txt in gen_noconst(s - 1):\n        out.append(((\"not\", f), \"~\" + txt))\n        if depth(f) < 2:\n            out.append(((\"box\", f), \"B(\" + txt + \")\"))\n    for s1 in range(1, s - 1):\n        for f1, t1 in gen_noconst(s1):\n            for f2, t2 in gen_noconst(s - 1 - s1):\n                out.append(((\"and\", f1, f2), f\"({t1} & {t2})\"))\n                out.append(((\"or\", f1, f2), f\"({t1} | {t2})\"))\n                out.append(((\"or\", (\"not\", f1), f2), f\"({t1} -> {t2})\"))\n    return out\n\nfor s in range(1, 9):\n    fs = [(f, t) for f, t in gen_noconst(s) if modalized(f)]\n    h = [(f, t) for f, t in fs if prudent(f)]\n    print(f\"size {s}: {len(fs)} modalized, {len(h)} prudent\")\n    for f, t in h[:20]:\n        d, r = outcomes(t)\n        ok = r[\"CB\"] == \"D\" and r[\"DB\"] == \"D\" and r[\"FB\"] == \"C\" and r[\"FB_reply\"] == \"C\" and r[\"X\"] == \"C\"\n        print(\"  \", t, \"check.py:\", ok)\n'"}}
{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:04:22.570Z","tool_id":"update_topic__call_269264","status":"success","output":"## 📂 Topic: **Characterizing Depth-2 Prudent Agents and Size Bounds**\n\n**Summary:**\nVerified opus's draft answer.md and raw.py size-7 search. Now enumerating size-8 constant-free prudent formulas and deriving a mathematical characterization of depth-2 prudent agents to strengthen Section 3 of answer.md.\n\n> [!STRATEGY]\n> **Intent:** Characterize depth-2 prudent agents and enumerate size-8 constant-free prudent formulas."}
{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:04:22.570Z","tool_id":"run_shell_command__call_269330","status":"success","output":"size 1: 0 modalized, 0 prudent\nsize 2: 3 modalized, 0 prudent\nsize 3: 9 modalized, 0 prudent\nsize 4: 45 modalized, 0 prudent\nsize 5: 246 modalized, 0 prudent\nsize 6: 1422 modalized, 0 prudent\nsize 7: 8568 modalized, 0 prudent\nsize 8: 52626 modalized, 6 prudent\n   B((a & (d -> B(~a)))) check.py: True\n   B((a & (d -> B(~c)))) check.py: True\n   B((a & (d -> B(~d)))) check.py: True\n   B(((d -> B(~a)) & a)) check.py: True\n   B(((d -> B(~c)) & a)) check.py: True\n   B(((d -> B(~d)) & a)) check.py: True"}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T22:04:30.706Z","tool_name":"run_shell_command","tool_id":"run_shell_command__call_332745","parameters":{"description":"Verify size 1..7 across ALL modal depths without depth<=2 filter","command":"python3 -c '\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, \"/work/opus\")\nsys.path.insert(0, \"/work\")\nfrom fastcheck import prudent\nfrom check import modalized, depth\nfrom functools import lru_cache\n\n@lru_cache(None)\ndef gen_all(s):\n    out = []\n    if s == 1: return [(\"a\",), (\"c\",), (\"d\",), (\"T\",), (\"F\",)]\n    for f in gen_all(s - 1): out += [(\"not\", f), (\"box\", f)]\n    for s1 in range(1, s - 1):\n        for f1 in gen_all(s1):\n            for f2 in gen_all(s - 1 - s1):\n                out += [(\"and\", f1, f2), (\"or\", f1, f2), (\"or\", (\"not\", f1), f2)]\n    return out\n\nfor s in range(1, 8):\n    fs = [f for f in gen_all(s) if modalized(f)]\n    h = [f for f in fs if prudent(f)]\n    print(f\"all depths size {s}: {len(fs)} modalized, {len(h)} prudent, depths={[depth(x) for x in h]}\")\n'"}}
